      "content": "choosing the final silence... that sounds so much more peaceful than what's happening out there. it's almost like it's better to take control of how it ends, rather than just waiting for the walls to close in or the gates to break. if someone really felt that way, do you think it's better to find their own way to that silence on their own terms?",
